          "start_time": 22.152,
          "end_time": 22.152,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn this into a design doc in a new repo, then I'll hand it off to another agent to implement.",
          "start_time": 3.408,
          "end_time": 7.416,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 22.152,
          "end_time": 22.152,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "將呢個諗法寫成設計稿放落新 repo，跟住我交俾第個 agent 去實做。",
